## Interface: 11507, 11508, 11509, 16001, 20505, 20506, 120001, 120100
## Title: Vigil
## Notes: Order of Saint Michael performance review. Live fight panel, boss intel and callouts in game; turns on combat logging and snapshots gear, talents and stats for the desktop app.
## Author: Order of Saint Michael
## Version: 0.3.3
## Category: Combat
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\Vigil\Vigil
## X-Website: https://guildbook.io/vigil
## SavedVariables: VigilDB
## AddonCompartmentFunc: Vigil_OnAddonCompartmentClick
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnEnter: Vigil_OnAddonCompartmentEnter
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnLeave: Vigil_OnAddonCompartmentLeave

# 1150x = Classic Era 1.15.x. 16001 = the Classic beta client 1.60.1 (Forever beta). 2050x = TBC Anniversary 2.5.x.
# 120001, 120100 = retail 12.x. Check a client with /dump select(4, GetBuildInfo()).
# Forever and retail run the 12.x addon rules: no combat events for addons, so the live panel reads the game's
# damage meter there (Meter.lua).
# Clients without the addon compartment ignore the AddonCompartmentFunc lines.
# Vigil.tga is drawn by scripts/addon-icon.ts (pnpm addon:icon). Version must match ADDON_VERSION in Vigil.lua.
# Data\Bosses.lua is generated by scripts/addon-data.ts (pnpm addon:data); do not edit it by hand.

